{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1429400-the-gift-of-the-elementals-and-spirit-influence","id":1429400,"title":"The Gift of the Elementals and Spirit Influence","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-12-21T11:50:46-08:00","id":1429400,"title":"The Gift of the Elementals and Spirit Influence","content":"This topic is meant to be a collection of interesting effects that could be done using The Gift of the Elementals.<br /> <br /> The Gift of Elementals states that the player gains Spiritual Influence over Fire, Water, Air, or Earth, equal to the Renown linked to that element.<br /> <br /> The description for Spiritual Influence in the core book is very broad. For example, at level 1 (<b>Strengthen</b>) the book states that the user can <i>add to the Defense of a beneficiary, make an emotion stronger, an animal or plant healthier, or an object more robust, gaining the spirit\u2019s Rank in Health or Structure</i>. Those examples work well for living things and objects, but I feel that I've never been able to come up with actual uses for that on some of the elements. Earth and Fire seem pretty obvious, with earth receiving structure/durability and fire increasing in intensity (and therefore damage), but even those seem very limited ideas to me. On top of that, what could this to to water and air?<br /> <br /> What are the effects that you guys allowed players to use on each of the 5 levels of Influece Elementals?<br /> <br /> \u2022 Strengthen<br /> \u2022\u2022 Manipulate<br /> \u2022\u2022\u2022 Control<br /> \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022 Create<br /> \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022 Mass Create","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5446-binaly","name":"BinAly","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5446_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"146"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-21T19:24:50-08:00","id":1429454,"title":"","content":"I'd like to direct you to this thread.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/428559-gift-of-the-elementals-question/page2\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/filedata/fetch?filedataid=1074\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/428559-gift-of-the-elementals-question/page2\"> Gift of the Elementals Question - Onyx Path Forums </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/428559-gift-of-the-elementals-question/page2\"> http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/428559-gift-of-the-elementals-question/page2 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Howdy. I just bought 2e, and I'm liking it so far. I like the idea of creating an Ithaeur and unleashing a can of elemental whoop-ass. However, I'm not sure how using influence with elements would work in combat. What kind of damage do they do? What are the special effects? How do enemies resist getting a </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> I think this has some answers you're looking for.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3028-viskarenvisla","name":"viskarenvisl